      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795185310927,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当模型很大  一张卡装不下 把模型中某一层的权重张量切分到多张 GPU 上\nTensor Parallelism\n简称TP（张量并行） ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当模型很大  一张卡装不下 把模型中某一层的权重张量切分到多张 GPU 上\nTensor Parallelism\n简称TP（张量并行） ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J-3mBaZgTvNUrlQeMhAEi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 584.6000061035156,
      "y": 809.9424238546712,
      "width": 840.7560424804688,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2021719418,
      "version": 365,
      "versionNonce": 1305848601,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795231143256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "理想情况下 一张卡把一个模型装下了 模型小 1张卡搞定 这个最简单",
