    {
      "id": "lwIL-XvjbUDp0A8LQoZXU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 544.8003540039062,
      "y": 1950.1785911953314,
      "width": 980.2239990234375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2131891656,
      "version": 549,
      "versionNonce": 1102308552,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795185304024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当模型很大，一张卡装不下，把模型按层分成多个阶段，分别放到多张 GPU 上\n前一张 GPU 的计算结果传给下一张 GPU，依次完成计算\nPipeline Parallelism\n简称PP（流水线并行）",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当模型很大，一张卡装不下，把模型按层分成多个阶段，分别放到多张 GPU 上\n前一张 GPU 的计算结果传给下一张 GPU，依次完成计算\nPipeline Parallelism\n简称PP（流水线并行）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IWhR3cWerAlZ0c0c5qaZC",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 554.1247355143229,
      "y": 2617.171846549205,
      "width": 919.9642740885416,
      "height": 517.4799041748047,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2119001800,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 22139576,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
