      ],
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "u7lieL8VOgLoYtWhdJXAs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 498.0606689453125,
      "y": 3106.1356161062195,
      "width": 1501.248046875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 794417848,
      "version": 1000,
      "versionNonce": 120097208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795185328822,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当模型一张卡能装下，但请求很多、一张卡忙不过来时，\n在多张 GPU 上分别放一份相同的完整模型，把不同请求分配给不同 GPU，同时处理并各自返回结果，提高整体吞吐量。\n\nData Parallelism\n简称 DP（数据并行）",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当模型一张卡能装下，但请求很多、一张卡忙不过来时，\n在多张 GPU 上分别放一份相同的完整模型，把不同请求分配给不同 GPU，同时处理并各自返回结果，提高整体吞吐量。\n\nData Parallelism\n简称 DP（数据并行）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6kWjtHJREyAoal2aiUebG",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 463.4532470703125,
      "y": 4028.025466580929,
      "width": 752,
      "height": 564,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
