      "updated": 1795231080341,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "一口气看懂大模型并行推理 \nTP PP DP EP CP ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "一口气看懂大模型并行推理 \nTP PP DP EP CP ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "X8U9Y62eRrKo1QN1N-kgW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1585.8344758264614,
      "y": 835.4716945183844,
      "width": 593.5999755859375,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1407623863,
      "version": 1119,
      "versionNonce": 210666713,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795231991880,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "但是当模型变大了，对硬件的要求就更高了\n优秀显卡三要素\n1. 计算够快\n2. 显存够大\n3. 通信够快\n满足这些条件，就可以并行的做事情了，就好像\n吃蛋糕，多个人吃肯定比一个人吃更快\n可以横着切 竖着切 横竖结合 只切某层等等做饭",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "但是当模型变大了，对硬件的要求就更高了\n优秀显卡三要素\n1. 计算够快\n2. 显存够大\n3. 通信够快\n满足这些条件，就可以并行的做事情了，就好像\n吃蛋糕，多个人吃肯定比一个人吃更快\n可以横着切 竖着切 横竖结合 只切某层等等做饭",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
